{"language":"en","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","火力全开"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/en","Unstoppable!"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","为累计造成伤害最高的友军提升攻击力和急速。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/en","Hugin increases the ATK and Haste of the ally with the highest cumulative damage dealt."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被动地，备战时呼金会在自身位置摆放锻造台，并在战斗中总是会前往锻造台所在位置普通攻击和释放技能；主动释放时，为累计造成伤害最高的友军锻造机械齿轮，使其攻击力提升，提升值等同于呼金6% + 1%的基础攻击力，且急速提高80点，持续10秒。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Passive. Hugin sets his anvil on the tile where he is placed during battle preparation. As his normal attacks and skills require the anvil, he will remain near it throughout the battle and will always return to it if displaced.\nActive. Hugin forges a Gear of Might for the ally dealing the highest cumulative damage, boosting their combat strength. The gear increases the ally's ATK by 6% + 1% of Hugin's base ATK and increases their Haste by 80 for 10s."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":91,"end":96,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":388,"end":393,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","攻击力提升至7% + 1%。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases the ATK boost to 7% + 1%."],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":13,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":29,"end":34,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","攻击力提升至8% + 1%。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases the ATK boost to 8% + 1%."],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":13,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":29,"end":34,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","攻击力提升至9% + 1%。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases the ATK boost to 9% + 1%."],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":13,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":29,"end":34,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","攻击力提升至10% + 1%。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/en","Increases the ATK boost to 10% + 1%."],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":14,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":30,"end":35,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","神奇盾甲"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/en","Titan's Aegis"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","为最虚弱的友军添加护盾。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/en","Hugin grants a shield to the weakest ally."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","为最虚弱的友军锻造齿轮护甲，使其获得可抵御600% + 60% ATK伤害的护盾，持续8秒。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Hugin crafts a cogshield for the weakest ally, allowing them to block 600% + 60% ATK damage for 8s."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":25,"end":31,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":74,"end":80,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":21,"end":35,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":70,"end":84,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","护盾抵御值上升至620% + 60% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases the shield value to 620% + 60% ATK."],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":34,"end":40,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":30,"end":44,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","护盾抵御值上升至640% + 60% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases the shield value to 640% + 60% ATK."],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":34,"end":40,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":30,"end":44,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","护盾抵御值上升至660% + 60% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases the shield value to 660% + 60% ATK."],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":34,"end":40,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":30,"end":44,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","齿轮链接"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/en","Mechanized Bond"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","身后一格的友军提升攻击力，还会在呼金释放“神奇盾甲”时恢复能量。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/en","Hugin increases the ATK of the ally 1 tile behind him. The buffed ally also recovers Energy whenever Hugin casts Titan's Aegis."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，呼金在身后一格布置机械联动装置。处于联动装置之上的友军的攻击力获得提升，提升值等同于呼金14% + 2%的基础攻击力，还会在呼金释放\"神奇盾甲\"时，获得传导的动能，额外回复75点能量。该效果在友军离开联动装置后消失。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/en","When a battle starts, Hugin etches a mechanical sigil one tile behind him, granting ally on this tile an ATK bonus equal to 14% + 2% of Hugin's base ATK. The buffed ally recovers an extra 75 Energy whenever Hugin casts Titan's Aegis. This buff disappears when the ally leaves the sigil."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":53,"end":58,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":127,"end":132,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"keyword:backonehex"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":54,"end":69,"tooltip_key":"keyword:backonehex"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","攻击力提升至16% + 2%。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases the ATK boost to 16% + 2%."],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":14,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":30,"end":35,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","攻击力提升至18% + 2%。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases the ATK boost to 18% + 2%."],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":14,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":30,"end":35,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","攻击力提升至20% + 2%。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases the ATK boost to 20% + 2%."],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":14,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":30,"end":35,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/en","Hero Focus"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身急速。"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/en","Increases Haste during battle."],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的急速提升12点。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Increases Haste by 12 during battle."],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的急速提升16点。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases Haste by 16 during battle."],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的急速提升20点。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases Haste by 20 during battle."],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","守护之谊"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/en","Steelbound Kinship"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","释放终极技能时，为最虚弱的2名友军添加护盾。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/en","When casting Unstoppable!, Hugin grants shields to the 2 weakest allies."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","释放终极技能时，额外为最虚弱的2名友军锻造改良型齿轮护甲，使其获得可抵御800% ATK伤害的护盾，持续8秒。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Hugin crafts enhanced cogshields for the 2 weakest allies when casting Unstoppable!, granting each with a shield that blocks 800% ATK damage for 8s."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":36,"end":44,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":125,"end":133,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","护盾抵御值上升至850%。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases the shield value to 850%."],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","获得改良型齿轮护甲提供的护盾的友军在持续期间内免疫控制效果。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Grants control immunity to allies protected by an enhanced cogshield while it's active."],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","护盾抵御值上升至900%。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases the shield value to 900%."],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/en","Enhance Force"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","护盾持续期间受到的伤害降低。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/en","While active, the shield Hugin grants also reduces the protected ally's damage taken."],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","齿轮护甲持续期间，还会使这名友军受到伤害降低30%。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/en","While the cogshield or enhanced cogshield is active, the protected ally also takes 30% less damage."],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","淬火流金"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/en","Molten Maul"]]}